# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — librtpi 1.0.0 HongMeng 内核 PI futex 能力缺口 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-19
# Software: librtpi 1.0.0
# Gate: 真机单包实测（ohos-test-runner / build_and_test.sh，LAN 10.62.178.77）
